ope for this relationship down the road yet.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-13T22:45:10-07:00","id":1402743,"title":"","content":"...Well that wasn\u2019t a notification I was expecting after a couple months of not signing in here and this <i>certainly</i> wasn\u2019t the direction I was expecting the necro to have gone in when I clicked said notification. O_o<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JesseM</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1334170-spun-or-unspun-the-paradox-of-time-travel?p=1391559#post1391559\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">3. &amp;quot;Mages who travel back in time and look forward find that the intervening span is still set&amp;quot;--so even if you are changing things in the past, it's as if you're just changing things in a new &amp;quot;draft&amp;quot; of history but when you look ahead you'll still see the original version of history prior to the present you departed from, with the altered draft only displacing the original once you return to the present. It isn't 100% clear from this whether other mages who are &amp;quot;native&amp;quot; to that draft of the past would also see only a single possible future up until the point the time-traveling mage had come from, or whether they might see multiple possible futures, reflecting the fact that the altered timeline of the draft could go in multiple different ways.</div> </div> </div> </div>For the record for anyone who doesn\u2019t speak math, this was my question/thought. Either your present suddenly stops being \u201cthe\u201d present the moment you encounter a time traveler or anything an active time traveler\u2019s touched (as initially proposed back when the thread had a Life aura), or someone\u2019s running around to whom the next hour\u2019s events appear much less mutable than they do to everyone else.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-14T10:06:53-07:00","id":1402820,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sith_Happens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1334170-spun-or-unspun-the-paradox-of-time-travel?p=1402743#post1402743\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Either your present suddenly stops being \u201cthe\u201d present the moment you encounter a time traveler or anything an active time traveler\u2019s touched (as initially proposed back when the thread had a Life aura), or someone\u2019s running around to whom the next hour\u2019s events appear much less mutable than they do to everyone else.</div> </div> </div> </div>As mentioned initially, from an objective standpoint the &quot;you&quot; that is encountering time traveler in this scenario is a sentient recording that starts potentially going off-script once it's brought into the time traveler's ripple of influence. If that recording happens to be able to read the future, it's going to come up with the original sequence of events until the cutoff point of the time-traveler's present \u2014 Doylistically, the prophetic lock-in is there to keep you from checking your work without multiple attempts at changing the past, and that doesn't work if you can just ask a different precog if you're on the right track.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}